  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently when you own parts of a bundle the it stays the same price. This results in the bundle it self no longer being appealing to users who own parts of it.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nWhen you own part of a bundle, reduce its price the appropriate amount.\n\nThis is makes buying the bundle for users who already own parts of it interesting again and would align with how other platforms, e.g. Steam, do this.",
